         ```                                                                    
                                                                                
         2. Add installation of the missing dependency (requests) to the        
         Dockerfile (inserts a RUN pip install requests line before EXPOSE).    
         ```bash                                                                
         sed -i '/^EXPOSE/ i RUN pip install requests'                          
         /home/hugov/KubeLLM-Minh/debug_assistant_latest/troubleshooting/readine
         ss_missing_dependency/Dockerfile                                       
         ```                                                                    
                                                                                
         3. Rebuild the image and load it into the cluster. This uses minikube  
         image build when minikube is available; otherwise it falls back to a   
         local docker build. (Build context is the directory containing the     
         Dockerfile.)                                                           
         ```bash                                                                
         if minikube profile list >/dev/null 2>&1; then                         
         PROFILE=${MINIKUBE_PROFILE:-$(kubectl config current-context)};        
         minikube -p "$PROFILE" image build -t                                  
         kube-readiness-missing-dependency-app -f                               
         /home/hugov/KubeLLM-Minh/debug_assistant_latest/troubleshooting/readine
         ss_missing_dependency/Dockerfile                                       
         /home/hugov/KubeLLM-Minh/debug_assistant_latest/troubleshooting/readine
         ss_missing_dependency; else docker build -t                            
         kube-readiness-missing-dependency-app -f                               
         /home/hugov/KubeLLM-Minh/debug_assistant_latest/troubleshooting/readine
         ss_missing_dependency/Dockerfile                                       
         /home/hugov/KubeLLM-Minh/debug_assistant_latest/troubleshooting/readine
         ss_missing_dependency; fi                                              
         ```                                                                    
                                                                                
         4. Recreate the Pod so Kubernetes starts containers from the           
         newly-built local image (deletes any existing pod and reapplies the    
         manifest).                                                             
         ```bash                                                                
         kubectl delete pod readiness-missing-dependency-app --ignore-not-found 
         && kubectl apply -f                                                    
         /home/hugov/KubeLLM-Minh/debug_assistant_latest/troubleshooting/readine
         ss_missing_dependency/readiness_missing_dependency.yaml                
         ```                                                                    
                                                                                
         5. Wait for readiness and check the new container logs to confirm the  
         ImportError is gone.                                                   
         ```bash                                                                
         kubectl wait --for=condition=ready pod/readiness-missing-dependency-app
         --timeout=60s && kubectl logs readiness-missing-dependency-app -c app  
         ```                                                                    
                                                                                
         If you cannot rebuild the image, I don't know any other durable fix; a 
         temporary workaround would be to edit /home/hugov/.../server.py to     
         remove or guard the `import requests` line (e.g. prefix with `#`), then
         rebuild the image as above.                                            
                                                                                
